Async Alembic migration environment.

Schema source of truth: SQLAlchemy models under app/models/.
The migration env imports app.models so all tables register with Base.metadata.

Common commands (run from ynab_insights/):

  alembic revision -m "describe change"          # blank migration
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."       # diff-based
  alembic upgrade head                            # apply all
  alembic downgrade -1                            # roll back one

The app runs `alembic upgrade head` on startup via the FastAPI lifespan.
